    "Aura is a native SwiftUI client for the Navidrome or Subsonic library you host yourself. No ads, no tracking, no cloud in between.": {
      "comment": "A description of the app.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
